  "description": "Search Builder helps create dynamic LINQ filtering conditions through properties decorated with [FieldMap].\n      It supports mapping database columns, specifying condition types (KindField), and comparison operators (Operation).\n      The system automatically generates LINQ expressions to use with EF Core .Where(...) and now also supports dynamic sorting.",
